VALUES ('Call to protect community-based Local Employment Services', 'call-to-protect-community-based-local-employment-services', '<figure aria-describedby="caption-attachment-250567"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Joe-Saunders-ILDN-150x150.jpg" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Joe-Saunders-ILDN-150x150.jpg 150w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Joe-Saunders-ILDN-440x440.jpg 440w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Joe-Saunders-ILDN-24x24.jpg 24w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Joe-Saunders-ILDN-48x48.jpg 48w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Joe-Saunders-ILDN-96x96.jpg 96w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Joe-Saunders-ILDN-300x300.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><figcaption>• Joe Saunders, ILDN.</figcaption></figure>
<p>The network urged the Government to consider the rollout of a Local Development Company-led employment services model as part of its response to the unemployment crisis arising from the Covid-19 pandemic.<br />
It rejected the idea of for-profit companies replacing the Local Employment Services.<br />
“Cost-per-unit models do not serve jobseekers well,” said ILDN manager Joe Saunders. “There is no upside in cost, governance or service levels with such a model.”</p>
<p>Mr Saunders said, “Our members are concerned regarding proposed changes to the inclusive, community-based, not-for-profit model of public employment services in Ireland currently operated by Local Employment Services. Thus, we have provided government with an offer to provide additional community-based services nationally that will be open to all jobseekers including those who don’t currently qualify for welfare payments.”<br />
Local Development Companies have 25 years operational experience in preparing jobseekers for work and are familiar with the multiple barriers facing long-term unemployed people. “Employment Services must be part of the integrated provision of social and personal service as part of a non-profit based public employment service,” he said.<br />
<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/ildn-logo-copy-150x150.jpg" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/ildn-logo-copy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/ildn-logo-copy-440x440.jpg 440w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/ildn-logo-copy-24x24.jpg 24w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/ildn-logo-copy-48x48.jpg 48w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/ildn-logo-copy-96x96.jpg 96w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/ildn-logo-copy-300x300.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" />Mr Saunders added: “Employment services are best located in community settings, operated by providers who can tailor to local circumstances, building relations with local employers. LDCs have a key strength in providing holistic wraparound services for individuals, families and communities.”</p>
<p><strong><u>BACKGROUND:</u></strong></p>
<p>The Department of Social Protection provides a nationwide Public Employment Service. It is delivered either by the Department’s own Intreo service, or by community-based, not-for-profit companies operating the Local Employment Service (LES) and Jobs Clubs, or by private contractors.</p>', 'The Irish Local Development Network (ILDN) representing Ireland’s 49 Local Development Companies (LDCs) has called on Oireachtas members “to ensure that the future of community-based Local Employment Services are protected and developed”.', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/LES-staff-in-Kerry-NEWKD-as-featured-on-RTEs-Nationwide.jpg', '', '[{"slug":"empowerment","title":"Empowerment"},{"slug":"income-employment","title":"Income & Employment"}]', '[{"slug":"ildn","title":"ILDN"},{"slug":"local-employment-service","title":"Local Employment Service"}]', '', 250560, 1, '2021-04-20T12:25:04Z', '2021-04-20T12:36:20Z', '2021-04-20T12:25:04Z')
